---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../site.json';
import ads from '../config/monetization.json';
const live=site.launchReady&&ads.coupang.enabled&&Object.values(ads.coupang.dynamicBanners).some(b=>b.enabled);
---
<Layout title={'Advertising disclosure | '+site.title} description={'Advertising and affiliate policy for '+site.title}>
<div class="wrap content"><p class="eyebrow">TRANSPARENCY</p><h1>Advertising and affiliate disclosure</h1>
{live?<p><strong>Affiliate advertisement:</strong> this website participates in Coupang Partners and receives a commission from qualifying purchases through Coupang dynamic banners. 이 사이트는 쿠팡 파트너스 활동의 일환으로 이에 따른 일정액의 수수료를 제공받습니다.</p>:<p>Coupang Partners dynamic banner placements have been prepared, but they are not active. Google AdSense is disabled until separately approved and configured.</p>}
<h2>Independent editorial decisions</h2><p>Editorial answers are independent of monetization. Dynamic banners show products served by Coupang and are sponsored content, not verified individual product recommendations by this site.</p>
<h2>Placement and labelling</h2><p>Sponsored banners are labelled advertisements and kept separate from navigation and troubleshooting instructions. Products are not selected or linked individually by this site.</p>
<h2>Data and privacy</h2><p>External advertising scripts are not loaded while disabled. When enabled, Coupang may process information under its own privacy policies. Review our <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> and applicable consent requirements before activation.</p>
</div></Layout>